{"title":"*Being and Time: An Annotated Translation*","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/948376949/0/marginalrevolution~Being-and-Time-An-Annotated-Translation.html","date":1771921969000,"content":"<p>Translated from the German by Cyril Welch.</p>\r\n<p>Periodically I am asked if I have read <em>Being and Time</em>, and I always give the same response: “I have looked at every page.”</p>\r\n<p>I also have spent time with it in German, though not for every page.  But have I read it?  Read it properly?  Can anyone?</p>\r\n<p>Is the book worth some study?  Yes.  But.</p>\r\n<p>People, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Being-Time-Translation-Martin-Heidegger/dp/0300282729/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1UUYIRAX4WVSE&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.x3sT0czhlK5t9ZBmf4T4jm8Jd3YbwJ9oZH4DysqLZALGjHj071QN20LucGBJIEps.WbopT-IR7O9NXu-giZ1oCdOnDq_7eRhu4yZ7k8ipCmA&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Being+and+Time%3A+An+Annotated+Translation&amp;qid=1771806771&amp;sprefix=being+and+time+an+annotated+translation%2Caps%2C123&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">this volume</a> is the best chance you are going to get.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/being-and-time-an-annotated-translation.html\">*Being and Time: An Annotated Translation*</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/948376949/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/948376949/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/948376949/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/948376949/margi